<title>KUWAIT: Perry says strike on Iraq still possible.</title>
<headline>Perry says strike on Iraq still possible.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defence Secretary William Perry said on Sunday further U.S. military action against Iraq was still a possibility.</p>
<p>Asked whether more U.S. strikes against Iraq were still possible, he told a news conference in the Gulf state of Kuwait: &quot;Yes, it is still a possibility.&quot;</p>
</text>
